<title>BELGIUM: Belgian net debt totalled 9,828.8 bln bfr in Aug.</title>
<headline>Belgian net debt totalled 9,828.8 bln bfr in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Treasury released the following data on the state's debt - (in bln francs)</p>
<p>    STATE DEBT	     end-Aug   change in mth  change in 1996</p>
<p>Long-term debt</p>
<p>    - Belgian francs     6,921.1   +53.9	     +215.8</p>
<p>    - foreign currencies   685.2    -6.0	     -113.7</p>
<p>Short-term debt</p>
<p>    - Belgian francs     1,883.6    +0.3	     +226.3</p>
<p>    - foreign currencies   284.6    +3.0		 -0.8</p>
<p>    Net debt		 9,828.8   +20.2	     +308.0</p>
<p>    Net borrowing requirement	+27.4	     +317.1</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
